"Responsible for the management and purification of the water supply used for"
" the Emperor’s consumption and daily needs."
msgstr ""

#. Description of Japanese Yasui Map constellation Bureau of Textiles
msgid ""
"An office in charge of the production and weaving of high-quality fabrics "
"and garments for court officials."
msgstr ""

#. Description of Japanese Yasui Map constellation Bureau of Sake Brewing
msgid ""
"Managed the production of sake, which was essential for religious ceremonies"
" and official court banquets."
msgstr ""

#. Description of Japanese Yasui Map constellation Saiku (The Palace of the
#. Saio)
